<title>POLAND: SOKOLOW TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 2.9.</title>
<headline>SOKOLOW TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 2.9.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 750,000 shares of Polish meat processor Sokolow SA at 2.9 zlotys per share was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session Sokolow rose 8.6 percent to 3.15 zlotys in a volume of 733,630 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
